FILE: src/components/ChartRenderer.tsx
PURPOSE: Renders a Vega-Lite specification passed as a prop using vega-embed; reads live CSS custom properties to theme the chart to match the active colour mode.
COMPONENT: ChartRenderer
PROPS: spec
HOOKS: useEffect (×1), useRef (×1), useTheme (custom — from ThemeContext)
RENDERS: (single div container only)
USED_BY: src/components/MessageBubble.tsx
CONTEXT: reads ThemeContext (isDark — triggers re-render on mode change)
STYLES: src/index.css (chart-container) — also reads CSS vars at runtime via getComputedStyle
